messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 99 and 20?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 99 and 20, I can use the distributive property of multiplication over addition.\n\nFirst, I'll break down 99 into 100 minus 1.\n\nThen, I'll multiply each part by 20:\n100 multiplied by 20 is 2000, and 1 multiplied by 20 is 20.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract 20 from 2000 to get the final result.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
