messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 26 and 36?', "<think>\nTo find the product of 26 and 36, I can use the standard multiplication method.\n\nFirst, I'll break down 26 into 20 and 6. Then, I'll multiply each part by 36.\n\n20 multiplied by 36 is 720, and 6 multiplied by 36 is 216.\n\nFinally, I'll add these two results together to get the total product.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
