messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 74 and 96?', "<think>.\nTo find the product of 74 and 96, I can use the standard multiplication method.\n\nFirst, I'll break down 96 into 90 and 6 to simplify the calculation.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 74 by 90. Multiplying by 90 is the same as multiplying by 9 and then by 10. So, 74 multiplied by 9 is 666, and then multiplied by 10 gives 6,660.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 74 by 6, which equals 444. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
